Z||000000||turbo86se||05-14-2000||11:06 AM||||<BR>Here's some quick info about the show:<BR>Historic Williamsburg Virginia<BR>June 15-18, 2000<BR>Hotel Accomodations: Ramada Inn and Conference Center, (Historic area) 500 Merrimac Trail  Williamsburg, VA 23185<BR>(800) 666-8888 or (757) 220-1410<BR>Room rate $84.00 single/ dbl occupancy<BR>Reservations accepted thru May 16th, then first come first served basis. Personal checks not accepted.<P>Car Show-Cruise-Banquet-Vendor Space Available-Dash Plaques to All Entries!!<P>Thursday 15th: Arrival and Hospitality<BR>Friday 16th: Car cruise and sightseeing<BR>Saturday 17th: Car show and banquet<BR>Sunday 18th: Fare Well's<P>Registration Fee- $35.00 per Fiero<BR>Banquet Fee- $25.00 per person<BR>Make registration and banquet fee checks payable to Curry Obenshain mail with completed registration and banquet form to FOCOSEVA Fiero Festival<BR>PO Box 297<BR>White Marsh, VA 23183<P>Car Show Catagories: <BR>Best Coupe (Stock & Modified)<BR>Best SE (stock & Modified)<BR>Best GT (stock & Modified)<BR>Best of Show<BR>High Miler (driven to show)<BR>Highest Mileage (odometer)<BR>Best Engine Compartment<BR>Best Paint<BR>Best Interior<BR>Best Club Participation<P>Alright, as of now we've got several Carolina Fiero owners attending. We all need to set a time to leave, if we can all get together, and caravan there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Sounds like lots of fun, and bring the cameras!!!<BR>||||reg||1
